[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14402.79, "timestamp": "04:00:02", "text": "嘿，我应该这样做来降低"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14411.389, "timestamp": "04:00:11", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14414.79, "timestamp": "04:00:14", "text": "嗯，这些东西只会减少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14429.83, "timestamp": "04:00:29", "text": "我可以睡到明天，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14435.11, "timestamp": "04:00:35", "text": "就像服务员送来的礼物一样，只是份量更少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14439.469, "timestamp": "04:00:39", "text": "好的。那么，这个呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14441.91, "timestamp": "04:00:41", "text": "事物？这样我就可以增加"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14445.15, "timestamp": "04:00:45", "text": "时尚潮流也同样重要，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14452.51, "timestamp": "04:00:52", "text": "[音乐]"}]